      1 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَذَأَهُ</span></b> , (S, K,) aor. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">يَذَأُ</span>, (TA,) inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَذْءٌ</span>,
(S,) <i>He imputed to him a vice, fault,</i> or <i>the
like; despised him;</i> (S, K;) <i>chid him;</i> (S, K;)
<i>and blamed,</i> or <i>reproached him.</i> (A'Obeyd.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2- 
